{"about_the_game":"Race to victory through a mayhem-filled obstacle course of deadly traps you\u2019ve built with friends while pulling off sick tricks!<br><br><strong>Ultimate Sheep Raccoon</strong> is a bike-racing party game where you and your friends build a course of ramps, obstacles, and traps! Dodge hazards, do crazy tricks, and use power-ups to get ahead of the competition. Pedal to victory with up to 8 players locally, online, and cross-platform.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/extras/c2ab731518235db8bafaf7889e075f3e.poster.avif?t=1771546895\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/extras/c2ab731518235db8bafaf7889e075f3e.webm?t=1771546895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/extras/c2ab731518235db8bafaf7889e075f3e.mp4?t=1771546895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Bike to victory</strong></h2> Race to the finish on your bikes! With easy-to-pick-up and intuitive controls, everyone can play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power-ups</strong></h2> Stay ahead of the competition with power-ups! Lift off with the jetpack, glide safely over threats with the parachute, scatter opponents with bouncy mines or stop them in their tracks with honey traps.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Blocks and traps</strong></h2>Build the level together by adding rails, ramps, bouncy pads, speed zones, and other obstacles. Then amp up the difficulty with pendulums, spinning machinery, spikes, and laser-emitting TVs!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/extras/608ab87831c64c0c6e4268d63969f4f8.poster.avif?t=1771546895\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/extras/608ab87831c64c0c6e4268d63969f4f8.webm?t=1771546895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/extras/608ab87831c64c0c6e4268d63969f4f8.mp4?t=1771546895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sick tricks</strong></h2>Pull off tricks and do backflips and wheelies to rack up extra points!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic characters</strong></h2>Chicken, Horse, Sheep, and Raccoon return from <i>Ultimate Chicken Horse</i>! Plus a brand-new cast of barnyard buddies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8-player support</strong></h2>Because 4 players weren\u2019t enough!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local, online and cross-platform multiplayer</strong></h2>Play together on all supported platforms.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom level editor &amp; playlists</strong></h2>Build and share your own level designs. Create challenge levels where players compete for the best times, and put together level playlists for a campaign-like experience.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Need Training Wheels?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2923350/ef563bc88ad4c2e57981f8fafb818f0b3440fcef.jpg"},{"name":"Need a Helmet?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2923350/81281e584c8b46692c1420bd50b401f744bb362c.jpg"},{"name":"Not Horsin' Around","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2923350/3bb41dd19284ca640ab82c9728ec3b08313393f2.jpg"},{"name":"Discover Your Style","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2923350/afdc0e04d26aaa0556bee017090b7a37a3f131b4.jpg"},{"name":"Trickster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2923350/cf1115a13fb3b1cda8e5658a0ab9df40155bc995.jpg"},{"name":"Hesitation Station","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2923350/bcde0656ec155c1cb678cab1aa172b0efb3d2351.jpg"},{"name":"High Flyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2923350/bf2c3582c2101d9ed1b15738d63fe88684d3ef49.jpg"},{"name":"Burnquist Award","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2923350/46fedea6f8fd767ef1d106943fdb6b69387b52e3.jpg"},{"name":"Nothing Can Stop Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2923350/88874cc5904181d9356fa473b040428c5b90ea3f.jpg"},{"name":"A Varied Taste","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2923350/82bdd8e1704591e01a6e33ab0ea6b20f40d7ea0d.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2923350?t=1771546895","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771546895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/3553fa126643546f8c0d3d296d2c3a65152a2a9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771546895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/3553fa126643546f8c0d3d296d2c3a65152a2a9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771546895","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've put together a roadmap of fixes and improvements for Ultimate Sheep Raccoon based on your feedback and concerns. We really want to make the game into the best version we can, so we'll regularly change this roadmap as we hear from the community and release updates. \u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's the newest roadmap, and we'll be updating it as we go. We've already done a lot of work on the project post-launch and we're continuing to do so, check out the []last update here[/url].\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/extras/25ee7893f56f9b095ee7ed853729a18f.avif?t=1771546895\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Race to victory through a mayhem-filled obstacle course of deadly traps you\u2019ve built with friends while pulling off sick tricks!<br><br><strong>Ultimate Sheep Raccoon</strong> is a bike-racing party game where you and your friends build a course of ramps, obstacles, and traps! Dodge hazards, do crazy tricks, and use power-ups to get ahead of the competition. Pedal to victory with up to 8 players locally, online, and cross-platform.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/extras/c2ab731518235db8bafaf7889e075f3e.poster.avif?t=1771546895\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/extras/c2ab731518235db8bafaf7889e075f3e.webm?t=1771546895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/extras/c2ab731518235db8bafaf7889e075f3e.mp4?t=1771546895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Bike to victory</strong></h2> Race to the finish on your bikes! With easy-to-pick-up and intuitive controls, everyone can play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power-ups</strong></h2> Stay ahead of the competition with power-ups! Lift off with the jetpack, glide safely over threats with the parachute, scatter opponents with bouncy mines or stop them in their tracks with honey traps.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Blocks and traps</strong></h2>Build the level together by adding rails, ramps, bouncy pads, speed zones, and other obstacles. Then amp up the difficulty with pendulums, spinning machinery, spikes, and laser-emitting TVs!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/extras/608ab87831c64c0c6e4268d63969f4f8.poster.avif?t=1771546895\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/extras/608ab87831c64c0c6e4268d63969f4f8.webm?t=1771546895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/extras/608ab87831c64c0c6e4268d63969f4f8.mp4?t=1771546895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sick tricks</strong></h2>Pull off tricks and do backflips and wheelies to rack up extra points!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic characters</strong></h2>Chicken, Horse, Sheep, and Raccoon return from <i>Ultimate Chicken Horse</i>! Plus a brand-new cast of barnyard buddies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8-player support</strong></h2>Because 4 players weren\u2019t enough!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local, online and cross-platform multiplayer</strong></h2>Play together on all supported platforms.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom level editor &amp; playlists</strong></h2>Build and share your own level designs. Create challenge levels where players compete for the best times, and put together level playlists for a campaign-like experience.","developers":["Clever Endeavour Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923350/56a010e4b8d6afc5be654578ff017bbf5fc7f01d/header.jpg?t=1771546895","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Clever Endeavour Games 2024","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2923350/1410366630/1d7917555df65e5bde387a80472fa27bd3cc43ec/1765240766/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765303330","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2923350/1410366630/1d7917555df65e5bde387a80472fa27bd3cc43ec/1765240766/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765303330","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2923350/1410366630/1d7917555df65e5bde387a80472fa27bd3cc43ec/1765240766/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765303330","id":257245451,"name":"Ultimate Sheep Raccoon Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257245451/1745ee7901aa25d0ebc410e20be2a15a52995c37/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765303330"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2923350/1004951123/0f21cae7e38b38a9c8ddecbeaacc4d6b58d961b5/1755109458/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765303128","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2923350/1004951123/0f21cae7e38b38a9c8ddecbeaacc4d6b58d961b5/1755109458/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765303128","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trai